sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Bidder H5
  participant W as WS Gateway
  participant B as Bid Engine
  participant L as Redis Lua place_bid.lua
  participant S as Redis Stream
  participant P as Redis PubSub
  participant R as Room Clients
  participant PW as Persistence Worker
  participant M as MySQL

  C->>W: BID_PLACE(clientBidId, amountCents)
  W->>W: auth, room check, rate limit
  W->>B: place bid command
  B->>L: EVAL place_bid.lua
  L->>L: dedupe lookup and retry returns original ack
  L->>L: validate status Bidding and Redis TIME
  L->>L: validate increment, cap, rate limit
  L->>L: INCR single seq, HSET state, ZADD leaderboard
  L->>S: XADD auction events with Stream ID seq-0
  L->>P: PUBLISH room event
  alt accepted below cap
    L-->>B: OK_ACCEPTED(seq, amount, endAtMs, extended)
    B-->>W: BID_ACCEPTED(seq)
  else cap reached
    L-->>B: OK_SOLD(seq, finalAmount, winnerId)
    B-->>W: AUCTION_SOLD(seq)
  else rejected
    L-->>B: ERR_NOT_LIVE / ERR_TOO_LOW / ERR_AFTER_END / ERR_RATE_LIMITED / ERR_AUCTION_PAUSED
    B-->>W: BID_REJECTED(reason)
  end
  W-->>C: ack with serverTimeMs
  P-->>W: room wakeup
  W-->>R: BID_ACCEPTED / USER_OUTBID / AUCTION_EXTENDED / AUCTION_SOLD
  PW->>S: consume ordered events
  PW->>M: idempotent insert bids and auction_events
